      ],
      "source": "https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Stephens_City%2C_Virginia"
    },
    {
      "id": 5,
      "text": "Near town, the Historic Route 11 Drive‑In Theatre offers a two‑screen experience that echoes mid‑century cinema culture.",
